# Vector 4 - GENERATE AC response, Format 2 (constructed 77 template)
# Published EMV / OpenSCDP sample. Synthetic; no live cardholder data.
# 77 > 9F27 CID = 00 (AAC / decline), 9F36 ATC = 0041, 9F26 AC (8 octets, opaque),
# 9F10 IAD (18 octets, opaque). The AC and IAD are never interpreted by this library.
77 29 9F 27 01 00 9F 36 02 00 41 9F 26 08 C7 4D 18 B0 82 48 FE FC 9F 10 12
01 10 20 10 09 24 84 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 29 FF
